WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:06.720
The Long Term Plan or LTP may sound...a&nbsp;
tad boring but it's so important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:12.320
for Waimakariri because it helps define how we're&nbsp;
going to grow and the rates we're going to pay.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.880
Dan, I can't believe you're in&nbsp;
the same park at the same time!

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.480
John, I can't believe I've seen you here,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:19.040
in fact I've never seen you&nbsp;
before, it's lovely to meet you!

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.440
Well listen, as a stranger, LTP?

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:25.840
Yeah, so we're coming into Council's Long&nbsp;
Term Plan, so basically it's our budget&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:30.560
and so the things that we're looking at is the&nbsp;
sort of growth that we've got in our district,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.360
the sort of needs that we have and&nbsp;
how we're going to pay for them.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:41.600
The LTP budgets for the Council's critical work:&nbsp;
roads pipes and rubbish collection but also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:47.520
places that provide a sense of community&nbsp;
such as libraries, pools, parks and of course&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:49.760
sports facilities.

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:56.400
So each LTP is a balancing act&nbsp;
between what the District needs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.000
what the residents want and&nbsp;
what the Council can afford.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:04.560
So if there's something the public&nbsp;
want the Council to do or indeed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:06.320
don't want the Council to do?

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:08.000
Now's the time to tell us.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:18.000
To find out more visit&nbsp;
waimakariri.govt.nz/letstalk

